ayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]没有啦，补给什么的交给{myName}买就好。[r][l]我只是想着，既然有了钱，能不能找个铁匠给我保养下装备什么的。[r]你看，这儿都给蜘蛛挠开线了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]结果这么大个驿站，都没个师傅能帮上忙……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1c","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1c","transTime":300,"x":750,"y":-204,"img":"chara004_1","scaleY":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]唔……那也是没办法的事。现在我们的锻工和护甲匠都被困在了远方的黑铁煅炉……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]啊，对了。{myName}既然是工匠，对保养和强化装备肯定也颇有心得吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]正好，侍者们清扫地窖的时候，找到了一块放了很久的铁砧。[r][l]如果你们想要的话，我就让茜塔给你们送到营地去吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]这样一来，只要在营地，你们就能随时对装备进行强化了。如何，你们需要吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","tran